OpenVDB: point legacy FindBoost at our destdir

OpenVDB 8.2's CMakeLists calls find_package(Boost) without CONFIG
mode, routing through CMake's legacy FindBoost.cmake. Our Boost 1.84
install provides only the modern BoostConfig.cmake (+ the component
sub-configs boost_iostreams-1.84.0/... etc), so the legacy finder
reports:
    Could NOT find Boost (missing: Boost_INCLUDE_DIR iostreams system)

Pass explicit BOOST_ROOT + Boost_DIR to OpenVDB's CMAKE_ARGS so both
the legacy and config-mode code paths work. Also disable system
search and prefer static linking (matching SLIC3R_STATIC=ON).

Retire-if: OpenVDB bumps to a version that uses BoostConfig natively,
or OrcaSlicer rolls OpenVDB forward to 10.x which handles modern
Boost cleanly.

---
diff --git a/deps/OpenVDB/OpenVDB.cmake b/deps/OpenVDB/OpenVDB.cmake
index df6ad9c913..e5edc5ff84 100644
--- a/deps/OpenVDB/OpenVDB.cmake
+++ b/deps/OpenVDB/OpenVDB.cmake
@@ -17,15 +17,24 @@ orcaslicer_add_cmake_project(OpenVDB
     PATCH_COMMAND git apply ${OPENVDB_DIRECTORY_FLAG} --verbose --ignore-space-change --whitespace=fix ${CMAKE_CURRENT_LIST_DIR}/0001-clang19.patch
     DEPENDS dep_TBB dep_Blosc dep_OpenEXR dep_Boost
     CMAKE_ARGS
-        -DCMAKE_POSITION_INDEPENDENT_CODE=ON 
+        -DCMAKE_POSITION_INDEPENDENT_CODE=ON
         -DOPENVDB_BUILD_PYTHON_MODULE=OFF
         -DUSE_BLOSC=ON
-        -DOPENVDB_CORE_SHARED=${_build_shared} 
+        -DOPENVDB_CORE_SHARED=${_build_shared}
         -DOPENVDB_CORE_STATIC=${_build_static}
         -DOPENVDB_ENABLE_RPATH:BOOL=OFF
         -DTBB_STATIC=${_build_static}
         -DOPENVDB_BUILD_VDB_PRINT=ON
         -DDISABLE_DEPENDENCY_VERSION_CHECKS=ON # Centos6 has old zlib
+        # OrcaXR: OpenVDB 8.2's CMakeLists uses the legacy FindBoost.cmake
+        # module and searches for Boost_INCLUDE_DIR. Our Boost is 1.84
+        # installed with its modern CMake config only. Point both the
+        # legacy finder and the config-mode finder at our destdir.
+        -DBOOST_ROOT=${DESTDIR}
+        -DBoost_DIR=${DESTDIR}/lib/cmake/Boost-1.84.0
+        -DBoost_NO_SYSTEM_PATHS=ON
+        -DBoost_USE_STATIC_LIBS=ON
+        -DBoost_USE_MULTITHREADED=ON
 )
 
 if (MSVC)
